ts-heading">Benefits and perks</h2></div></div><div class="ab-marketing-vertical-section__content"><ul class="ab-careers-benefits__grid"><li class="ab-careers-benefits__grid-item"><article class="ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card--copy ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card--copy-icon"><div class="ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card_inner"><span class="ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card_icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="0" height="0" class="ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card_icon-defs" style="position:absolute;width:0;height:0;overflow:hidden" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="_R_4l6d5a_" x1="36.6673" y1="24.1982" x2="3.33522" y2="23.9951" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop offset="0.00480771" stop-color="var(--figma-gradient-1a, #5D51D5)"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--figma-gradient-1b, #CECBF2)"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="40" height="40" stroke="url(#_R_4l6d5a_)" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 19.4c0 1.436-1.12 2.6-2.5 2.6S12 20.836 12 19.4V12m-9.874-1.594C2.89 5.641 7.02 2 12 2s9.11 3.64 9.874 8.406c.074.465.111.698.018.946a1.097 1.097 0 0 1-.44.516c-.23.132-.504.132-1.052.132H3.6c-.548 0-.821 0-1.052-.132a1.097 1.097 0 0 1-.44-.516c-.093-.248-.056-.48.018-.946Z"></path></svg></span><div class="ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card_copy"><h5 class="ab-marketing-heading-5 ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card_title">Time off that&#x27;s actually time off</h5><p class="ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card_description">Unlimited PTO with a real floor: we encourage at least 25 days off a year.</p></div></div></article></li><li class="ab-careers-benefits__grid-item"><article class="ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card--copy ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card--copy-icon"><div class="ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card_inner"><span class="ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-card_icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="0" height="0" class="ab-mcp-gateway-use-case-